{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hant",
  "strings": {
    "已啟用直接輸入": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Direct input enabled"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已启用直接输入"}}}},
    "直接輸入需要權限": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Direct input needs permission"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"直接输入需要权限"}}}},
    "啟用直接輸入": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Enable Direct Input"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"启用直接输入"}}}},
    "介面語言": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Interface Language"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"界面语言"}}}},
    "中文輸出": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Chinese Output"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"中文输出"}}}},
    "繁體": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Traditional"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"繁体"}}}},
    "簡體": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Simplified"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"简体"}}}},
    "中文": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Chinese"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"中文"}}}},
    "開啟輔助使用設定": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Open Accessibility Settings"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"打开辅助功能设置"}}}},
    "允許輔助使用": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Allow Accessibility"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"允许辅助功能"}}}},
    "先允許 LaSay；若提示未出現，再開啟輔助使用設定。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Allow LaSay first. If the prompt does not appear, open Accessibility Settings."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"先允许 LaSay。如果没有出现提示，再打开辅助功能设置。"}}}},
    "完成後返回 LaSay；權限會自動偵測，不必重新啟動。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Return to LaSay when finished. The permission is detected automatically; you do not need to restart."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"完成后返回 LaSay；权限会自动检测，无需重新启动。"}}}},
    "用來把文字直接輸入目前的 App": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Types text directly into the current app"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"用来把文字直接输入目前的 App"}}}},
    "LaSay 預設會直接輸入到游標；若自動輸入失敗，結果仍會留在剪貼簿。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "LaSay types at the cursor by default. If direct input fails, the result stays on the clipboard."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"LaSay 默认直接输入到光标位置；若自动输入失败，结果仍会留在剪贴板。"}}}},
    "文字已複製": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Text Copied"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"文字已复制"}}}},
    "已複製文字，請按 Command-V 貼上": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Text copied. Press Command-V to paste."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"文字已复制，请按 Command-V 粘贴。"}}}},
    "LaSay 只在你按住快捷鍵時錄音，並把辨識結果貼到目前的 App。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "LaSay records only while you hold the shortcut, then pastes the result into the current app."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"LaSay 只在你按住快捷键时录音，并将识别结果粘贴到当前 App。"}}}},
    "全域快捷鍵：%@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Global shortcut: %@"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"全局快捷键：%@"}}}},
    "請按住 %@ 說話，放開後自動辨識": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Hold %@ while speaking; release to transcribe automatically"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"按住 %@ 说话，松开后自动识别。"}}}},
    "點一下文字框，按住 %@ 說話，放開後 LaSay 會把結果貼進來。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Click the text box, hold %@ while speaking, then release. LaSay will paste the result here."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"点一下文字框，按住 %@ 说话，放开后 LaSay 会把结果贴进来。"}}}},
    "一般": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "General"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"一般"}}}},
    "允許": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Allow"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"允许"}}}},
    "兩個權限，約一分鐘": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Two permissions, about one minute"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"两个权限，约一分钟"}}}},
    "在系統設定確認登入項目": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Confirm Login Items in System Settings"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在系统设置中确认登录项"}}}},
    "成功！LaSay 已經可以在任何 App 使用。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Success! LaSay now works in any app."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"成功！LaSay 已经可以在任何 App 使用。"}}}},
    "按住 %@ 說話，放開後自動輸入": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Hold %@ to speak; release to type"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"按住 %@ 说话，放开后自动输入"}}}},
    "按住說話快捷鍵": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Push-to-talk shortcut"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"按住说话快捷键"}}}},
    "提示：短按不會錄音，請按住、說話、再放開。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Tip: Hold the shortcut, speak, then release."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"提示：短按不会录音，请按住、说话、再放开。"}}}},
    "檢查更新...": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Check for Updates..."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"检查更新..."}}}},
    "權限開啟後會自動繼續，不必重新啟動 App。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Permissions are detected automatically. You do not need to restart the app."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"权限打开后会自动继续，无需重新启动 App。"}}}},
    "用來接收快捷鍵並貼上文字": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Receives the shortcut and pastes text"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"用于接收快捷键并粘贴文字"}}}},
    "用來錄下你說的話": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Records what you say"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"用来录下你说的话"}}}},
    "登入後自動啟動 LaSay": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Launch LaSay at login"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"登录后自动启动 LaSay"}}}},
    "登入後自動啟動（推薦）": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Launch at login (Recommended)"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"登录后自动启动（推荐）"}}}},
    "移除贅字、修正文法並保留技術術語（使用 OpenAI）": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Remove filler words, fix grammar, and preserve technical terms (uses OpenAI)"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"移除赘词、修正语法并保留技术术语（使用 OpenAI）"}}}},
    "自動整理口語文字": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Automatically polish spoken text"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自动整理口语文字"}}}},
    "說一句話，就設定完成": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Say one sentence to finish setup"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"说一句话，即可完成设置"}}}},
    "重新執行設定...": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Run Setup Again..."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"重新运行设置..."}}}},
    "輸入後還原原本的剪貼簿": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Restore the previous clipboard after typing"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"输入后还原原本的剪贴簿"}}}},
    "辨識方式": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Transcription"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"识别方式"}}}},
    "開啟系統設定": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Open System Settings"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"打开系统设置"}}}},
    "開始使用 LaSay": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Start Using LaSay"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"开始使用 LaSay"}}}},
    "點一下文字框，按住 Fn + Space 說話，放開後 LaSay 會把結果貼進來。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Click the text box, hold Fn + Space while speaking, then release. LaSay will paste the result here."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"点一下文字框，按住 Fn + Space 说话，放开后 LaSay 会把结果贴进来。"}}}},
    "關於 LaSay": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "About LaSay"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"关于 LaSay"}}}},
    "聯繫：tamio.tsiu@gmail.com": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Contact: tamio.tsiu@gmail.com"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"联系：tamio.tsiu@gmail.com"}}}},
    "SenseVoice 離線辨識 + 雲端 OpenAI": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "SenseVoice offline recognition + OpenAI cloud"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"SenseVoice 离线识别 + OpenAI 云端"}}}},
    "AI 文字清理（保留技術術語）": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "AI text cleanup (preserves technical terms)"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"AI 文字清理（保留技术术语）"}}}},
    "全域快捷鍵：Fn + Space": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Global shortcut: Fn + Space"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"全域快捷键：Fn + Space"}}}},
    "任何 app 都能用，包括 Terminal 和 IDE": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Works in any app, including Terminal and IDEs"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"任何 app 都能用，包括 Terminal 和 IDE"}}}},
    "功能：": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Features:"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"功能："}}}},
    "給開發者的語音輸入工具": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Voice input for developers"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"给开发者的语音输入工具"}}}},
    "LaSay": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "LaSay"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"LaSay"}}}},
    "版本 %@ (Build %@)": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Version %@ (Build %@)"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"版本 %@ (Build %@)"}}}},
    "進階設定": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Advanced Settings"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"高级设置"}}}},
    "AI 清理：移除贅字、修正文法、保留技術術語": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "AI cleanup: removes filler words, fixes grammar, and preserves technical terms"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"AI 清理：移除赘词、修正语法、保留技术术语"}}}},
    "AI 文字潤飾": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "AI Text Polish"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"AI 文本润色"}}}},
    "AI 潤飾開關": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "AI Polish switch"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"AI 润色开关"}}}},
    "移除口語贅字、修正文法、優化句子結構": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Remove filler words, fix grammar, and improve sentence structure"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"移除口语赘字、修正文法、优化句子结构"}}}},
    "AI 潤飾失敗": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "AI Polish Failed"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"AI 润色失败"}}}},
    "API 錯誤：": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "API Error:"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"API 错误："}}}},
    "用於雲端語音轉錄與 AI 文字潤飾": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Used for cloud transcription and AI text polishing"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"用于云端语音转录与 AI 文本润色"}}}},
    "請在設定中輸入 OpenAI API Key 以使用雲端模式": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Enter your OpenAI API key in Settings to use Cloud mode"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请在设置中输入 OpenAI API Key 以使用云端模式"}}}},
    "需要 API Key": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "API Key Required"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"需要 API Key"}}}},
    "儲存 API Key": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Save API Key"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"保存 API Key"}}}},
    "已設定 API Key": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "API Key configured"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已设置 API Key"}}}},
    "顯示或隱藏 API Key": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Show or hide API Key"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"显示或隐藏 API Key"}}}},
    "返回": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Back"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"返回"}}}},
    "取消": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Cancel"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"取消"}}}},
    "自動儲存（API Key 除外）": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Auto-save (except API Key)"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自动保存（API Key 除外）"}}}},
    "關閉": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Close"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"关闭"}}}},
    "目前使用：%@": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Currently using: %@"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目前使用：%@"}}}},
    "你可以在這裡自訂 AI 潤飾的指令": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Customize the AI Polish instructions here"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你可以在这里自订 AI 润饰的指令"}}}},
    "自訂": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Custom"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自订"}}}},
    "自訂 System Prompt（選填）": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Custom system prompt (optional)"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自订 System Prompt（选填）"}}}},
    "預設": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Default"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"默认"}}}},
    "刪除": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Delete"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"删除"}}}},
    "刪除 API Key": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Delete API Key"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"删除 API Key"}}}},
    "刪除後，雲端模式和 AI 潤飾將無法使用，直到重新輸入 API Key。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Cloud mode and AI Polish will be unavailable until you enter an API key again."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"删除后，云端模式和 AI 润饰将无法使用，直到重新输入 API Key。"}}}},
    "確定刪除 API Key？": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Delete this API key?"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"确定删除 API Key？"}}}},
    "啟用 AI 潤飾（使用 GPT-5-mini）": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Enable AI Polish (uses GPT-5-mini)"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"启用 AI 润饰（使用 GPT-5-mini）"}}}},
    "請輸入 API Key (sk-...)": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Enter API Key (sk-...)"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请输入 API Key (sk-...)"}}}},
    "完成": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Done"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"完成"}}}},
    "取得 API Key → platform.openai.com": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Get an API Key → platform.openai.com"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"取得 API Key → platform.openai.com"}}}},
    "隱藏": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Hide"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"隐藏"}}}},
    "待機": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Ready"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"待机"}}}},
    "API Key 無效 (401)。前往設定更新 Key。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Invalid API key (401). Open Settings to update it."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"API Key 无效 (401)。请前往“设置”更新。"}}}},
    "無效的 API 回應": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Invalid API response"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"无效的 API 回应"}}}},
    "無效的音訊檔案": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Invalid audio file"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"无效的音讯档案"}}}},
    "LaSay 語音輸入": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "LaSay Voice Input"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"LaSay 语音输入"}}}},
    "麥克風權限被拒絕。請前往「系統設定 > 隱私權與安全性 > 麥克風」啟用權限。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Microphone access was denied. Go to System Settings > Privacy & Security > Microphone to enable it."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"麦克风权限被拒绝。请前往“系统设置 > 隐私与安全性 > 麦克风”启用权限。"}}}},
    "需要麥克風權限": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Microphone Access Required"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"需要麦克风权限"}}}},
    "找不到語音模型": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Speech model not found"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"找不到语音模型"}}}},
    "模型載入中...": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Loading model..."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"模型载入中..."}}}},
    "網路錯誤：無法連線至 API。檢查網路或切換至本地模式。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Network error: Could not connect to the API. Check your connection or switch to Local mode."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"网络错误：无法连接 API。请检查网络或切换至本地模式。"}}}},
    "下一步": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Next"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"下一步"}}}},
    "輔助使用": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Accessibility"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"辅助功能"}}}},
    "完成後會自動偵測": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "It will be detected automatically when complete"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"完成后会自动检测"}}}},
    "在系統提示中完成以下步驟：": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Complete the following steps in System Settings:"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在系统提示中完成以下步骤："}}}},
    "若系統提示沒有出現，請使用下方按鈕。": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "If the System Settings prompt does not appear, use the button below."}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"若系统提示没有出现，请使用下方按钮。"}}}},
    "點擊「打開系統設定」": {"localizations": {"en": {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Click “Open System Settings”"}}, "zh-Hans": {"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"点击“打开系统设置”"}}}},
